        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: James Hetfield, Lars Ulrich\n- Organizations: Metallica\n- Products: \"Mama Said\", Load, The Recycler\n- Concepts: power ballad, songwriting credits\n\nFacts:\n- In October 1981, James Hetfield co-founded Metallica after answering a classified advertisement placed by drummer Lars Ulrich in the Los Angeles newspaper The Recycler.\n- \"Mama Said\" is a power ballad by the American heavy metal band Metallica from the band's sixth album Load.\n- James Hetfield wrote the music and lyrics for \"Mama Said\", and the music is credited to Hetfield and Lars Ulrich.",
